From: Honmani <noreply@honmani.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Measure a chapter before saving the position in it

Turning back over a chapter boundary in the paginated reader lands on the
previous chapter's last page, but the paragraphs' positions were measured
only after the next frame: the automatic bookmark saved the chapter's
start, and a resize before the next page turn jumped there.

diff -ru a/apps/web/src/lib/components/book-reader/book-reader-paginated/book-reader-paginated.svelte b/apps/web/src/lib/components/book-reader/book-reader-paginated/book-reader-paginated.svelte
--- a/apps/web/src/lib/components/book-reader/book-reader-paginated/book-reader-paginated.svelte	2026-11-25 07:00:25.504935343 +0100
+++ b/apps/web/src/lib/components/book-reader/book-reader-paginated/book-reader-paginated.svelte	2026-11-25 07:00:25.557046572 +0100
@@ -410,6 +410,7 @@
       customReadingPointRange = undefined;
     }
 
+    calculator.updateParagraphPosIfMissing();
     exploredCharCount = calculator.calcExploredCharCount(customReadingPointRange);
 
     if (isUser) {
diff -ru a/apps/web/src/lib/components/book-reader/book-reader-paginated/section-character-stats-calculator.ts b/apps/web/src/lib/components/book-reader/book-reader-paginated/section-character-stats-calculator.ts
--- a/apps/web/src/lib/components/book-reader/book-reader-paginated/section-character-stats-calculator.ts	2026-11-25 07:00:25.505177429 +0100
+++ b/apps/web/src/lib/components/book-reader/book-reader-paginated/section-character-stats-calculator.ts	2026-11-25 07:00:25.555473729 +0100
@@ -64,6 +64,11 @@
     this.calculator.updateParagraphPos(this.virtualScrollPos$.getValue());
   }
 
+  /** The positions of a section just shown are otherwise measured only after the frame, too late for its bookmark. */
+  updateParagraphPosIfMissing() {
+    if (typeof this.calculator?.paragraphPos[0] !== 'number') this.updateParagraphPos();
+  }
+
